OL,3,GNEWSACall for 'transparency' over #68m
OL,4,Aflood scheme information
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man behind the freedom of
OL,7,Finformation (FOI) requests where a
OL,8,Fcouncil response was found to be
OL,9,F"entirely unacceptable" has called for
OL,10,Fsomeone to be held to account.
OL,12,FMike Sutherland said he believed there
OL,13,Fhad been a "catalogue of errors" in the
OL,14,Fhandling of the #68m Whitesands flood
OL,15,Fprotection scheme in Dumfries.
OL,17,FThe Scottish Information Commissioner
OL,18,F(SIC) recently ruled that Dumfries and
OL,19,FGalloway Council had "failed at the
OL,20,Fmost basic level" in its response to
OL,21,Fhis requests about the project.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
